   "label": "f03-shared-favorite",
   "front": "What is the shared-favorite caveat?",
   "back": "Page.IsFavorite is one page-level boolean, not per member: starring a page stars it for the whole workspace. Intentional simplification; notification targeting avoids depending on per-user favorites (ADR 0007).",
